        "id": 1011323
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T14:08:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I believe we should only generate this rule if it was explicitly requested. \n\nOnly very few plugins require now additional test dependencies (e.g. `spanner-refdb`).\n\nIn the past, we haven\u0027t exposed `mockito` and friends, but now we do:\n\n./java/com/google/gerrit/acceptance/BUILD\n```python\nexported_deps \u003d [\n    \":function\",\n    \"//lib:jgit-junit\",\n    \"//lib:jimfs\",\n    \"//lib:servlet-api\",\n    \"//lib/httpcomponents:fluent-hc\",\n    \"//lib/httpcomponents:httpclient\",\n    \"//lib/httpcomponents:httpcore\",\n    \"//lib/mockito\",\n    \"//lib/truth\",\n    \"//lib/truth:truth-java8-extension\",\n    \"//lib/greenmail\",\n    \"//lib:guava-testlib\",\n]\n```",
      "parentUuid": "6c3d6a22_a651d2ab",
      "revId": "869a1334ea9df16f8e5d4204265c561d6c8240f9",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
